<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/14/msa@/~cl_5__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "c" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/14/msa@> .
